Maieutics Actor Runtime

Derived from @ghostflyby/worker-actor 0.7.0 by ghostflyby.
Source: https://github.com/ghostflyby/worker-actor
Imported commit: bbc0d235ae54455147af6ad399edf5d64dc0be95
License: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

This copy is maintained as part of Maieutics. Package imports and test fixture
locations have been adapted to the Maieutics SDK package and build pipeline.
Subsequent Maieutics changes add browser connections, separate host-only adapters,
observable transport lifetimes and admission budgets, and credit-driven streams
(internal Actor protocol version 2). See ADR 0053.
